{
  "Items.OviElixir.BellyBigger": "[pg]A rumble radiates from your uterus as it shifts uncomfortably and your belly gets a bit larger."
  "Items.OviElixir.BellyHeavier": "[pg]Your pregnant belly suddenly feels heavier and more bloated than before. You wonder what the elixir just did."
  "Items.OviElixir.Desc": "This hexagonal crystal bottle is filled with a strange green fluid. A tag with a picture of an egg is tied to the neck of the bottle, indicating it is somehow connected to egg-laying."
  "Items.OviElixir.Drink": "You pop the cork and gulp down the thick greenish fluid. The taste is unusual and unlike anything you've tasted before."
  "Items.OviElixir.EggsStarted": "[pg]The elixir has an immediate effect on your belly, causing it to swell out slightly as if pregnant. You guess you'll be laying eggs sometime soon!"
  "Items.OviElixir.GooBlocked": "[pg]For a moment you feel even more bloated than you already are. That feeling is soon replaced by a dull throbbing pain. It seems that with Valeria's goo filling your womb the ovielixir is unable to work its magic on you."
  "Items.OviElixir.Long": "a hexagonal crystal bottle tagged with an image of an egg"
  "Items.OviElixir.NeedVagina": "You pop the cork and prepare to drink the stuff, but the smell nearly makes you gag. You cork it hastily.[pg]"
  "Items.OviElixir.OvimaxRumble": "[pg]You start to feel a bit of a rumble. You look down at your belly, and it seems to have started a slight twitch, and then stops. You take a look at the empty ovimax bottle for information when suddenly your womb lurches forward and your stomach starts to slightly expand. Dropping the ovimax bottle to the ground, you moan as your bury your face in the parched earth, a silent scream leaving your mouth as the rumbling in your tummy is turning more violent, and more painful... and then it stops completely. You shudder in the fetal position, waiting for another seizure that didn't come. Maybe you should stop drinking these things."
  "Items.OviElixir.Short": "Ovi Elixir"
  "Items.OviElixir.SpeedUp": "[pg]You gasp as your pregnancy suddenly leaps forwards, your belly bulging outward a few inches as it gets closer to time for birthing."
  "Items.OviElixir.WormBlocked": "[pg]For a moment you feel even more bloated than you already are. That feeling is soon replaced by a dull throbbing pain. It seems that with the worms filling your womb the ovielixir is unable to work its magic on you."
}
